<BaseLayout title="About | Sepulchral Index"><article class="article"><div class="kicker">About</div><h1>An international underground publication from Chile.</h1><div class="article-content"><p>Sepulchral Index is a provisional name for an independent digital publication focused on extreme metal. Its purpose is simple: select, document and preserve worthwhile underground activity without attempting to cover everything.</p><p>The publication is based in Chile and gives particular attention to Chilean and South American scenes while remaining international in scope.</p><h2>Lineage</h2><p>The project grows from the editorial experience behind printed underground fanzines with more than 20 issues.</p></div></article></BaseLayout>
